# name verdict. The free-list pool broken one way at a time, and the quantifier encoding. A verdict changing here is reviewed as a soundness or completeness change of zvc.
# Controls (proved): alloc, free, storeKeeps, storeSees.
lists.L.alloc proved
lists.L.allocEmpty refuted
lists.L.allocLoses refuted
lists.L.allocStuck refuted
lists.L.forallShort refuted
lists.L.free proved
lists.L.freeAndKeep refuted
lists.L.freeCycle refuted
lists.L.freeNoLink refuted
lists.L.freeTwice refuted
lists.L.freeUnchecked refuted
lists.L.freeWrongLink refuted
lists.L.storeBreaks refuted
lists.L.storeClobbers refuted
lists.L.storeKeeps proved
lists.L.storeSees proved
